# Implementation plan — Spec 1.12.1

## Summary

Add an **SMS** group to the WebOnOne left nav (**Send SMS**, **Devices**, **Queue**, **History**, **Templates**) using the same **iframe embed** channel as Email/Data. Extend `@webonone/platform-nav` sentinels; host peer in WebOnOne; verify SMS embed; wire satellite outbound redirects.

See [02-webonone-sms-nav.md](./02-webonone-sms-nav.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.12.1` |
| Prerequisite | SMS service from 1.12.0 runnable (`dev:sms`) |
| Services for manual test | Identity + WebOnOne + SMS (+ Data/Email for satellite hops) |
| New env | WebOnOne FE: `VITE_SMS_ORIGIN`; satellites: same when adding outbound |
| Packages | Rebuild / type-check `@webonone/platform-nav` before consumer type-check if needed |

---

## Phase 1 — platform-nav

**Goal:** SMS sentinels + nav group.

**Exit criteria:** Member nav has no SMS; main/superAdmin resolve five SMS hrefs when `externalOrigins.sms` set.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Types + sentinels + helpers | `packages/platform-nav/src/coreNav.ts` |
| Exports | `packages/platform-nav/src/index.ts` |
| Tests | `packages/platform-nav/src/coreNav.test.ts` |

**Verify:** package tests + type-check for platform-nav.

---

## Phase 2 — WebOnOne host

**Goal:** Left-nav clicks embed SMS in `#main-content`.

**Exit criteria:** All five SMS children load correct iframe paths; `embedMain` active.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Peer config | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/sms/utils/smsConfig.ts` |
| Env example | `webonone-v2/frontend/.env.example` |
| Peer frame | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/shell/pages/PlatformPeerFrame.tsx` |
| Router | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/app/router.tsx` — `sms/*` |
| Nav icons / resolve | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/shell/config/navItems.ts` |
| Embed path + prefetch | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/app/AppLayout.tsx`, `routePrefetch.ts` |

**Reference:** Email peer wiring in the same files.

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root`

---

## Phase 3 — SMS peer + satellite outbound

**Goal:** Embed works end-to-end; satellites hop to SMS correctly.

**Exit criteria:** WebOnOne embed content-ready; Data/Email → SMS Templates does not land on core Home.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Embed verify | `sms/frontend` AppLayout / PlatformEmbedLayout / FeaturePages for five routes |
| CSP / parents | `sms/frontend` vite CSP + `.env.example` |
| Outbound (per satellite) | `features/sms/utils/smsConfig.ts`, `redirectToSms.ts`, `AppLayout.tsx`, `.env.example` |

**Reference:** `webonone-v2/.../email/utils/redirectToEmail.ts`, [1.11.2](../1.11.2/02-cross-service-nav-fix.md)

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w sms-root` (+ email-root / data-root / identity-root as touched)

---

## Forbidden

- Reimplementing SMS admin pages inside `webonone-v2`
- Auth-code full-page redirect for WebOnOne left-nav SMS clicks (use embed)
- Per-route `VITE_SMS_*_URL` env keys
- Showing SMS group to `member` nav variant
- Putting Dashboard/Test in the **core** SMS group in this spec

---

## Acceptance (quick)

1. WebOnOne admin → SMS → each of five items embeds correct SMS route.
2. Member → no SMS menu.
3. Satellite → SMS sub-item → correct SMS path.
4. Type-checks green for touched packages/services.
